# Report a bug

::summary
The Report a bug hub destination in the shell wrapper: a write form (title, what happened, expected, steps), a screenshot file picker, and a read-only account of the page context the report will carry. The form POSTs to a real route; the file input, the hidden `context` / `from` carriers and the multipart enctype are spliced in server-side (surf-parse 0.18 has no file or hidden field kind and no enctype attribute).
::

::app-shell[name=report-bug layout=sidebar-main-panel height=1280]

:::sidebar[position=left width=240]

